---
layout: layouts/base.njk
lang: zh-TW
section: topics
title: 主題地圖
description: 從主題追讀已發表的文章。
permalink: /zh/topics/
---
{% set posts = collections.postsZh %}
<section class="topic-map-page" aria-labelledby="topic-map-title">
  <h1 id="topic-map-title">{{ site.i18n[lang].topicMap }}</h1>
  <ul class="topic-map-list" aria-label="{{ site.i18n[lang].topicMapLabel }}">
    {% for topic in site.topicCatalog %}
      {% set relatedPosts = posts | topicPosts(topic.id) %}
      {% if relatedPosts.length %}
      {% set connectedTopics = site.topicCatalog | topicConnections(topic.id, posts) %}
      <li class="topic-map-node" id="topic-{{ topic.id }}" data-topic-id="{{ topic.id }}">
        <details open>
          <summary>{{ topic.labels[lang] }}</summary>
          <p>{{ topic.description[lang] }}</p>
          {% if connectedTopics.length %}<p class="topic-connections"><span>{{ site.i18n[lang].connectedTopics }}:</span> {% for connectedTopic in connectedTopics %}<a href="#topic-{{ connectedTopic.id }}">{{ connectedTopic.labels[lang] }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}<span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>{% endif %}
          <ul>
            {% for post in relatedPosts %}<li><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.displayTitle }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </details>
      </li>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
